# Excel – Data Cleaning

Microsoft Excel Power Query was used to clean and prepare the DataCo dataset for SQL analysis.

### Files

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| Data_Cleaning.xlsx | Excel workbook used for data cleaning |
| Data_Cleaning_Log.xlsx | Documents identified issues and cleaning actions |

### Cleaning Activities

- Inspected dataset columns and data types.
- Checked missing values and duplicate records.
- Removed irrelevant and redundant columns.
- Standardized text and geographical values.
- Corrected date and numerical data types.
- Validated the cleaned dataset.

### Output

The cleaned dataset is available in the [Dataset folder](../Dataset/README.md).
